"discounts"
msgstr ""
"Smidlig prísáseting letur teg áseta fastan pakkaprís og bjóða lokkandi "
"avsláttir"

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1735
msgid ""
"Improved customer retention as clients return to use the remaining sessions "
"in their package"
msgstr ""
"Betri kundahald, tí kundar koma aftur fyri at brúka tær eftirverandi "
"seturnar í pakkanum"

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1736
msgid "Manage shared resources with ease"
msgstr "Umsit felags tilfeingi lættliga"

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1737
msgid ""
"Create rooms, equipment, or other resources that can be shared across "
"employees, services, or locations, ensuring customers only see time slots "
"when everything they need is truly available."
msgstr ""
"Stovna rúm, útgerð ella annað tilfeingi, sum kann deilast millum starvsfólk, "
"tænastur ella støð, so kundar bara síggja tíðir, tá alt, teimum tørvar, "
"veruliga er tøkt."

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1738
msgid ""
"Avoid double-booking by automatically coordinating shared rooms, equipment, "
"or tools"
msgstr ""
"Slepp undan tvíbóking við sjálvvirkandi at samskipa felags rúm, útgerð ella "
"amboð"

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1739
msgid ""
"Streamline operations with one central place to manage all resources across "
"your business"
msgstr ""
"Ger raksturin smidligari við einum miðsavnaðari staði til at umsita alt "
"tilfeingi í virkinum"

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1740
msgid ""
"Deliver a smoother booking experience by showing customers only real, "
"available time slots"
msgstr ""
"Gev kundum eina smidligari bókingaruppliving við bara at vísa veruligar, "
"tøkar tíðarlummar"

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1741
msgid "Boost revenue with valuable extras"
msgstr "Øk inntøkuna við virðismiklum eyka­valum"

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1742
msgid ""
"Offer optional or mandatory extras during the booking process - upsell "
"additional services, products, or experiences to enhance appointments and "
"delight your customers."
msgstr ""
"Bjóða valfrí ella kravd eyka undir bókingargongdini - sel eyka tænastur, "
"vørur ella upplivingar fyri at betra um tíðirnar og gleða kundarnar."

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1743
msgid ""
"Increase revenue by encouraging customers to purchase additional services or "
"products"
msgstr ""
"Øk um inntøkurnar við at eggja kundum til at keypa eyka tænastur ella vørur"

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1744
msgid ""
"Customize offerings to match specific services and meet diverse client needs"
msgstr "Tillaga tilboð, so tey hóska til ávísar tænastur og ymisk kundatørv"

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1745
msgid ""
"Enhance the customer experience with tailored add-ons that add convenience "
"and value"
msgstr ""
"Betra um kundaupplivingina við tillagaðum ískoytum, sum geva lættleika og "
"virði"

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1746
msgid "Effortless management for every location"
msgstr "Løtt umsiting fyri hvørt stað"

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1747
msgid ""
"Easily organize multiple business locations in one place, ensuring smooth "
"operations and a consistent booking experience no matter where your services "
"are offered."
msgstr ""
"Skipað fleiri vinnustøð lættliga á einum stað, so raksturin gongur smidliga "
"og bókingarupplivingin er støðug, sama hvar tænasturnar verða bodnar."

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1748
msgid ""
"Centralize scheduling across all branches for clearer, simpler management"
msgstr ""
"Savna tíðarætlanir tvørtur um allar deildir fyri greiðari og einfaldari "
"umsiting"

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1749
msgid ""
"Improve customer experience by letting clients choose the location that "
"suits them best"
msgstr ""
"Betra um kundaupplivingina við at lata kundar velja staðið, sum hóskar "
"teimum best"

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1750
msgid ""
"Keep operations aligned with unified settings, availability, and resource "
"control"
msgstr ""
"Halt rakstrinum samskipaðum við felags stillingum, tøkleika og "
"tilfeingisstýring"

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1751
msgid "Collect the information your business truly needs"
msgstr "Savna upplýsingarnar, sum fyritøkan veruliga hevur tørv á"

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1752
msgid ""
"Build tailored forms across services, events, and customer profiles using "
"custom fields. Capture exactly the details you need with checkboxes, text "
"areas, and more, turning every booking and registration into a powerful "
"intake process."
msgstr ""
"Bygg tillagað skjøl tvørtur um tænastur, tiltøk og kundaprofilar við "
"tillagaðum teigum. Savna júst tær upplýsingar, tú hevur tørv á, við "
"avkrossingarteigum, tekstøkjum og meira, so hvør bóking og skráseting verður "
"ein sterk móttøku­tilgongd."

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1753
msgid ""
"Customize every interaction by gathering the right information for services, "
"events, and customer records"
msgstr ""
"Tillaga hvørt samskifti við at savna røttu upplýsingarnar fyri tænastur, "
"tiltøk og kundaskráir"

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1754
msgid ""
"Keep your data organized and meaningful with structured fields that "
"standardize the information you collect"
msgstr ""
"Halt tíni dáta skipað og gagnlig við struktureraðum feltum, sum "
"standardisera upplýsingarnar, tú savnar"

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1755
msgid ""
"Enhance the customer experience with clear, intuitive forms designed around "
"your business needs"
msgstr ""
"Betra um kundaupplivingina við greiðum, lættskiljandi oyðubløðum, sum eru "
"sniðgivin eftir tørvinum hjá tínari fyritøku"

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1756
msgid "Automated invoices for a smoother payment experience"
msgstr "Sjálvvirkandi rokningar fyri eina lættari gjaldsuppliving"

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1757
msgid ""
"Automatically generate invoices for every booking, making payments easier, "
"more transparent, and fully streamlined for both you and your clients."
msgstr ""
"Ger sjálvvirkandi rokningar fyri hvørja bóking, so gjaldingar verða lættari, "
"greiðari og heilt smidligar fyri bæði teg og tínar kundar."

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1758
msgid "Save time and reduce manual work with instant, auto-generated invoices"
msgstr ""
"Spar tíð og minka um handaligt arbeiði við beinanvegin sjálvvirkandi "
"rokningum"

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1759
msgid ""
"Improve accuracy and professionalism with consistent, clearly formatted "
"billing"
msgstr ""
"Betra um neyvleika og professionellan dám við støðugari og greiðari "
"rokningargerð"

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1760
msgid ""
"Enhance client trust by providing transparent, documented payment details "
"for every booking"
msgstr ""
"Styrk álitið hjá kundum við greiðum, skjalfestum gjaldsupplýsingum fyri "
"hvørja bóking"

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1761
msgid "Drive bookings with irresistible coupon offers"
msgstr "Øk bókingar við lokkandi avsláttarkotutilboðum"

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1762
msgid ""
"Create unique coupon codes that customers can redeem during booking-offer "
"discounts or even free appointments to boost engagement, satisfaction, and "
"sales."
msgstr ""
"Stovna serstakar avsláttarkotur, sum kundar kunnu brúka undir bóking, bjóða "
"avsláttir ella enntá ókeypis tíðir fyri at økja um luttøku, nøgdsemi og sølu."

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1763
msgid ""
"Increase conversions by motivating customers with attractive, limited-time "
"deals"
msgstr ""
"Øk um umskapanir við at eggja kundum við lokkandi tilboðum í avmarkaða tíð"

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1764
msgid ""
"Flexible discount options let you set custom values or offer full-price "
"waivers"
msgstr ""
"Smidligir avsláttarmøguleikar lata teg áseta tillagað virði ella bjóða "
"fullan príseftirgeving"

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1765
msgid ""
"Enhance customer loyalty by rewarding clients with exclusive, personalized "
"offers"
msgstr ""
"Styrk kundatrygdina við at løna kundum við serligum, persónligum tilboðum"

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1766
msgid "Effortless tax management for every booking"
msgstr "Løtt mvg-/skattaumsiting fyri hvørja bóking"

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1767
msgid ""
"Automatically calculate and apply taxes to your services and events, "
"ensuring accurate billing and hassle-free compliance with every transaction."
msgstr ""
"Rokna og legg sjálvvirkandi skatt/mvg á tínar tænastur og tiltøk, so hvør "
"transaktión fær neyva rokningargerð og lætta reglufylgjan."

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1768
msgid "Eliminate manual calculations with smart, automated tax application"
msgstr ""
"Slepp undan handligum útrokningum við snildari, sjálvvirknari mvg-/"
"skattanýtslu"

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1769
msgid "Ensure accurate billing by applying the correct tax rates every time"
msgstr ""
"Tryggja rætta rokningargerð við altíð at brúka røttu mvg-/skattasatsirnar"

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1770
msgid ""
"Stay compliant with ease through consistent, reliable tax handling across "
"your business"
msgstr ""
"Halt reglurnar lættliga við støðugari og álítandi handfaring av mvg/skatti í "
"øllum virkinum"

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1771
msgid "Stay connected with WhatsApp notifications"
msgstr "Halt sambandið við WhatsApp-fráboðanum"

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1772
msgid ""
"Keep customers and employees informed by sending appointment and event "
"notifications directly through WhatsApp - choose predefined messages or "
"customize your own for a personal touch."
msgstr ""
"Halt kundar og starvsfólk kunnað við at senda fráboðanir um tíðir og tiltøk "
"beinleiðis gjøgnum WhatsApp - vel forskrivað boð ella tillaga tíni egnu fyri "
"ein persónligan dám."

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1773
msgid ""
"Boost engagement by reaching clients instantly on a platform they use every "
"day"
msgstr ""
"Øk luttøkuna við at røkka kundum beinanvegin á einum palli, sum teir brúka "
"hvønn dag"

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1774
msgid "Reduce no-shows with timely reminders sent automatically"
msgstr "Minka um ikki-møtingar við sjálvvirkandi áminningum í røttum tíma"

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1775
msgid ""
"Simplify communication with customizable messages for both customers and "
"employees"
msgstr ""
"Ger samskiftið einfaldari við tillagaðum boðum til bæði kundar og starvsfólk"

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1776
msgid "Simplify scheduling with recurring events"
msgstr "Ger tíðarlegging einfaldari við endurtakandi tiltøkum"

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1777
msgid ""
"Effortlessly set up and manage events that repeat on your preferred schedule-"
"offering flexibility, consistency, and a smooth experience for both your "
"business and your customers."
msgstr ""
"Set lættliga upp og umsita tiltøk, sum endurtaka seg eftir tínari valdu "
"tíðarætlan, og bjóða sveiggj, støðufesti og eina smidliga uppliving fyri "
"bæði tína fyritøku og tínar kundar."

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1778
msgid ""
"Save time by automating repeating events instead of creating them manually"
msgstr ""
"Spar tíð við at gera endurtakandi tiltøk sjálvvirkandi í staðin fyri at "
"stovna tey handaliga"

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1779
msgid ""
"Maintain consistent scheduling with customizable frequencies and patterns"
msgstr "Varðveit støðuga tíðarlegging við tillagaðum títtleikum og mynstrum"

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1780
msgid ""
"Improve customer convenience by offering predictable, easy-to-book recurring "
"options"
msgstr ""
"Ger tað lættari hjá kundum við at bjóða fyrisigiliga, endurtakandi "
"møguleikar, sum eru lættir at bóka"

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1781
msgid "Empower your team with seamless integrations"
msgstr "Styrk toymið við smidligum integratiónum"

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1782
msgid ""
"Connect employee calendars, meeting tools, and other integrations to keep "
"schedules perfectly synced and communication effortless across your entire "
"team."
msgstr ""
"Sambind kalendarar hjá starvsfólki, fundaramboð og aðrar integratiónir fyri "
"at halda tíðarætlanir væl samstillaðar og samskiftið lætt í øllum toyminum."

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1783
msgid ""
"Prevent scheduling conflicts with real-time calendar syncing for every "
"employee."
msgstr ""
"Forða fyri kalendarasamanstoytum við kalendarasamstilling í veruligari tíð "
"fyri hvørt starvsfólk."

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1784
msgid ""
"Streamline virtual meetings by integrating popular meeting platforms "
"directly into bookings."
msgstr ""
"Ger talgildar fundir smidligari við at sambinda væl umtóktar fundarpallar "
"beinleiðis í bókingar."

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1785
msgid "Boost team productivity with automated updates and fewer manual tasks."
msgstr ""
"Øk arbeiðsorkuna hjá toyminum við sjálvvirkandi dagføringum og færri "
"handligum uppgávum."

